{"path":"numeric/random/gamma_distribution","title":"std::gamma_distribution","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>gamma_distribution","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/numeric/random/gamma_distribution","section":"numeric","kind":"page","summary":"Produces random positive floating-point values x, distributed according to probability density function:","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/random\">&lt;random&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> RealType <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">class</span> gamma_distribution<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Produces random positive floating-point values <span class=\"texhtml\">x</span>, distributed according to probability density function:\n</p>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{p}(x\\mid\\alpha,\\beta) = \\frac{e^{-x/\\beta} }{\\beta^\\alpha\\cdot\\Gamma(\\alpha)}\\cdot x^{\\alpha-1}\">P(x|α,β) = <span class=\"t-mfrac\"><table><tr><td>e<span class=\"t-su\">-x/β<br></span></td></tr><tr><td>β<span class=\"t-su\">α<br></span> · Γ(α)</td></tr></table></span> · x<span class=\"t-su\">α-1<br></span></span>\n</dd></dl>\n<p>where <span class=\"texhtml\">α</span> is known as the <i>shape</i> parameter and <span class=\"texhtml\">β</span> is known as the <i>scale</i> parameter. The shape parameter is sometimes denoted by the letter <span class=\"texhtml\">k</span> and the scale parameter is sometimes denoted by the letter <span class=\"texhtml\">θ</span>.\n</p><p>For floating-point <span class=\"texhtml\">α</span>, the value obtained is the sum of <span class=\"texhtml\">α</span> independent exponentially distributed random variables, each of which has a mean of <span class=\"texhtml\">β</span>.\n</p><p><code>std::gamma_distribution</code> satisfies <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/RandomNumberDistribution\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">RandomNumberDistribution</em></a>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Template_parameters\">Template parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> RealType\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> The result type generated by the generator. The effect is undefined if this is not one of <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">float</span></span>, <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">double</span></span>, or <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">long</span> <span class=\"kw4\">double</span></span>.\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Member_types\">Member types</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Member type\n</td>\n<td> Definition\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>result_type</code> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span>\n</td>\n<td> <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">RealType</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>param_type</code> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span>\n</td>\n<td> the type of the parameter set, see <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/RandomNumberDistribution\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">RandomNumberDistribution</em></a>.\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions\">Member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/gamma_distribution/gamma_distribution\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(constructor)</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs new distribution <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/gamma_distribution/reset\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>reset</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  resets the internal state of the distribution <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h5 id=\"Generation\">Generation </h5>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/gamma_distribution/operator()\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator()</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  generates the next random number in the distribution <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h5 id=\"Characteristics\">Characteristics </h5>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/gamma_distribution/params\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>alpha</span><span>beta</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the distribution parameters <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/gamma_distribution/param\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>param</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  gets or sets the distribution parameter object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/gamma_distribution/min\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>min</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the minimum potentially generated value <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/gamma_distribution/max\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>max</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the maximum potentially generated value <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Non-member_functions\">Non-member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/gamma_distribution/operator_cmp\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator==</span><span>operator!=</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx20\">(removed in C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  compares two distribution objects <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/gamma_distribution/operator_ltltgtgt\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator&lt;&lt;</span><span>operator&gt;&gt;</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  performs stream input and output on pseudo-random number distribution <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;map&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;random&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/random_device\"><span class=\"kw1495\">std::<span class=\"me2\">random_device</span></span></a> rd<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/mersenne_twister_engine\"><span class=\"kw1498\">std::<span class=\"me2\">mt19937</span></span></a> gen<span class=\"br0\">(</span>rd<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// A gamma distribution with alpha = 1, and beta = 2</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// approximates an exponential distribution.</span>\n    std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">gamma_distribution</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&gt;</span> d<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/map\"><span class=\"kw1289\">std::<span class=\"me2\">map</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> hist<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> n <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> n <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">10000</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>n<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>hist<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> d<span class=\"br0\">(</span>gen<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> <span class=\"br0\">[</span>x, y<span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> hist<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>y <span class=\"sy2\">/</span> <span class=\"nu16\">100.0</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"nu16\">0.5</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/fixed\"><span class=\"kw1800\">std::<span class=\"me2\">fixed</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/setprecision\"><span class=\"kw1812\">std::<span class=\"me2\">setprecision</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n                      <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> x <span class=\"sy2\">/</span> <span class=\"nu16\">2.0</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'-'</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>x <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">/</span> <span class=\"nu16\">2.0</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">' '</span>\n                      <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>y <span class=\"sy2\">/</span> <span class=\"nu0\">100</span>, <span class=\"st0\">'*'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>0.0-0.5 **********************\n0.5-1.0 ****************\n1.0-1.5 *************\n1.5-2.0 **********\n2.0-2.5 ********\n2.5-3.0 ******\n3.0-3.5 *****\n3.5-4.0 ****\n4.0-4.5 ***\n4.5-5.0 **\n5.0-5.5 **\n5.5-6.0 *\n6.0-6.5 *\n6.5-7.0\n7.0-7.5\n7.5-8.0</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"External_links\">External links</h3>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mathworld.wolfram.com/GammaDistribution.html\" data-external=\"1\">Weisstein, Eric W. \"Gamma Distribution.\"</a> From MathWorld — A Wolfram Web Resource.\n</td></tr></table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Template parameters","id":"Template_parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Member types","id":"Member_types"},{"depth":3,"text":"Member functions","id":"Member_functions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Non-member functions","id":"Non-member_functions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"External links","id":"External_links"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"numeric","title":"Numerics library"},{"path":"numeric/random","title":"Pseudo-random number generation"}],"children":[{"path":"numeric/random/gamma_distribution/gamma_distribution","title":"std::gamma_distribution<RealType>::gamma_distribution"},{"path":"numeric/random/gamma_distribution/max","title":"std::gamma_distribution<RealType>::max"},{"path":"numeric/random/gamma_distribution/min","title":"std::gamma_distribution<RealType>::min"},{"path":"numeric/random/gamma_distribution/operator()","title":"std::gamma_distribution<RealType>::operator()"},{"path":"numeric/random/gamma_distribution/operator_cmp","title":"operator==,!=(std::gamma_distribution)"},{"path":"numeric/random/gamma_distribution/operator_ltltgtgt","title":"operator<<,>>(std::gamma_distribution)"},{"path":"numeric/random/gamma_distribution/param","title":"std::gamma_distribution<RealType>::param"},{"path":"numeric/random/gamma_distribution/params","title":"std::gamma_distribution<RealType>::alpha, beta"},{"path":"numeric/random/gamma_distribution/reset","title":"std::gamma_distribution<RealType>::reset"}],"map":{"label":"std::gamma_distribution","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Produces random positive floating-point values x, distributed according to probability density function:"},{"label":"Template parameters","note":"RealType"},{"label":"Member types","children":[{"label":"result_type (C++11)","note":"RealType"},{"label":"param_type (C++11)","note":"the type of the parameter set, see RandomNumberDistribution."}]},{"label":"Member functions","children":[{"label":"(constructor)","note":"constructs new distribution"},{"label":"reset","note":"resets the internal state of the distribution"},{"label":"operator()","note":"generates the next random number in the distribution"},{"label":"alpha, beta","note":"returns the distribution parameters"},{"label":"param","note":"gets or sets the distribution parameter object"},{"label":"min","note":"returns the minimum potentially generated value"},{"label":"max","note":"returns the maximum potentially generated value"}]},{"label":"Non-member functions","children":[{"label":"operator==, operator!=","note":"compares two distribution objects"},{"label":"operator<<, operator>>","note":"performs stream input and output on pseudo-random number distribution"}]},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++11","C++20"],"wordCount":374,"codeBlockCount":2}
